hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:
"15600","Yahya ibn Said narrated to us, he said: Ismail narrated to us, he said: Qays narrated to us, from his father, he said: He came while the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) was addressing, and stood in the sun. So he ordered concerning him, and he was moved to the shade."
"15601","Aswad ibn Amir narrated to us, Huraym narrated to us, from Ismail, from Qays ibn Abi Hazim, from his father, that he was in the sun, so the Prophet, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, ordered him to move to the shade, or to be put in the shade."
"15602","Muhammad ibn Jafar narrated to us, Shubah narrated to us, from Ismail, from Qays ibn Abi Hazim, that his father came while the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, was delivering the sermon, and he sat in the sun. He said: so he gestured to him, or he said: so he ordered him to move to the shade."
"15603","Waki narrated to us, Ibn Abi Khalid narrated to us, from Qays ibn Abi Hazim, from his father, he said: The Prophet, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, saw me while he was delivering the sermon, so he gave an order concerning me, and I was moved to the shade."
